                        ],
                        "form": "саморо́дках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3ae6b567-f7c7-3fec-b2c9-7ea3c2d6b596",
                        "entry_id": "c95991fa-be45-3f3c-855d-c054de08ebab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "геол. образовавшийся естественным образом кусок драгоценного металла"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ce7663b-c54d-41c0-bd19-bf1c1246b5ad",
                                "sense_id": "3ae6b567-f7c7-3fec-b2c9-7ea3c2d6b596",
                                "text": "Например, на Аляске, знаменитой своим золотом, за все время работ самый крупный найденный самородок весил всего 2400 г."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13ccf8a0-eb11-41f3-9728-8810017ec1d8",
                                "sense_id": "3ae6b567-f7c7-3fec-b2c9-7ea3c2d6b596",
                                "text": "В 1933 году в тех краях начали развивать золото-платиновую промышленность, нашли даже самородок в два килограмма, но после войны добычу золота прекратили."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2c0985a1-ef1d-3de6-8c7d-c4a4a2d213ab",
                        "entry_id": "c95991fa-be45-3f3c-855d-c054de08ebab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. одарённый, талантливый человек"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23328d66-cd86-4112-a4df-17761555842d",
                                "sense_id": "2c0985a1-ef1d-3de6-8c7d-c4a4a2d213ab",
                                "text": "Пропал ведь человек, сгинул уральский самородок, изобретатель лучшего в мире картофелеуборочного комбайна."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "95a6a067-45da-4ff6-8823-ecc40b50cfd9",
                                "sense_id": "2c0985a1-ef1d-3de6-8c7d-c4a4a2d213ab",
                                "text": "В 34 года этот российский самородок имел звание профессора химии, академика Петербургской Академии наук."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "714fe0d1-4f6b-4e30-9833-4c91466b31d8",
                        "source_entry_id": "c95991fa-be45-3f3c-855d-c054de08ebab",
                        "source_sense_description": "кусок металла",
                        "target_lang_word": "nugget",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nugget",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10efc133-55f6-378d-9bb4-440700a78b09",
                                        "entry_id": "0d93a55d-0141-3a8e-99e2-51b1635d0163",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small, compact chunk or clump."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0897b71-a1d5-4128-aa61-0c8645408d42",
                                                "sense_id": "10efc133-55f6-378d-9bb4-440700a78b09",
                                                "text": "a gold nugget"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "221f3e7f-9783-4ef5-8123-e07b19c72b31",
                                                "sense_id": "10efc133-55f6-378d-9bb4-440700a78b09",
                                                "text": "Rough men brought pickle bottles full of nuggets. Mysterious dirty-looking calico bags were opened, disclosing small quantities of water-worn flaky gold, which had been washed out of the beds of rivers with a cradle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89e59433-50fd-30b2-8835-a53aa467d62c",
                                        "entry_id": "0d93a55d-0141-3a8e-99e2-51b1635d0163",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A chicken nugget."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a1fb362-8927-45d0-a679-6ca4119b33b5",
                                                "sense_id": "89e59433-50fd-30b2-8835-a53aa467d62c",
                                                "text": "By now, we hope you have said “no” to processed nuggets and fingers. Instead, how about taking some real chicken, tossing it with real eggs, a little tangy mustard, and a crunchy quinoa coating?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a4a1bb8-d5e1-3ada-9a97-1cff4d36b99b",
                                        "entry_id": "0d93a55d-0141-3a8e-99e2-51b1635d0163",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tidbit of something valuable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfb9f438-c021-4aca-87e3-a3691be76a37",
                                                "sense_id": "7a4a1bb8-d5e1-3ada-9a97-1cff4d36b99b",
                                                "text": "a nugget of wisdom"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f47c2b8d-477d-429f-b475-830a2fbb04b3",
                                                "sense_id": "7a4a1bb8-d5e1-3ada-9a97-1cff4d36b99b",
                                                "text": "a nugget of truth"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2eb04ce5-5125-45c9-9f7a-b9301e12d70e",
                                                "sense_id": "7a4a1bb8-d5e1-3ada-9a97-1cff4d36b99b",
                                                "text": "As he has in superb works like “The Source” (based on the Afghanistan war logs leaked by Chelsea Manning) and “Sound From the Bench” (which set excerpts from Supreme Court proceedings), Hearne takes these found-text nuggets and gives them music that moves from lushly meditative to frenetic and obsessively repetitive […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e14eb787-40e6-341c-9b2c-eb016d8fef64",
                                        "entry_id": "0d93a55d-0141-3a8e-99e2-51b1635d0163",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small piece of tasty food, a tidbit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "652674ee-cb08-324b-af35-ec72ff186f4c",
                                        "entry_id": "0d93a55d-0141-3a8e-99e2-51b1635d0163",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of boot polish."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88b65f74-c6ba-3e54-8452-559a4eb37bba",
                                        "entry_id": "0d93a55d-0141-3a8e-99e2-51b1635d0163",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bud from the Cannabis sativa plant, especially one that is potent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d08933c4-b57c-36a9-acaa-b36eb470c7be",
                                        "entry_id": "0d93a55d-0141-3a8e-99e2-51b1635d0163",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An inexperienced, newly trained fighter pilot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3ef2c60-817f-4d5b-a742-3017a536f709",
                                                "sense_id": "d08933c4-b57c-36a9-acaa-b36eb470c7be",
                                                "text": "Jack stifled a smirk at the ensign's expressionless non-reaction. He'd been a nugget himself once, the new guy fresh from training."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bafaaff1-9ab1-32fe-a66c-c06c84c96f9b",
                                        "entry_id": "0d93a55d-0141-3a8e-99e2-51b1635d0163",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A partial description gleaned from data mining."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd33de88-8e32-4b8b-b494-479c61912eae",
                                                "sense_id": "bafaaff1-9ab1-32fe-a66c-c06c84c96f9b",
                                                "text": "We have previously said that the heuristic algorithms produce good nuggets for most classes and most λ values […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d184bfa-ae95-3e15-9590-836d083faf35",
